   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Russia Beyond (formerly Russia Beyond The Headlines), rebranded as Gateway to Russia in December 2024, is a Russian multilingual project operated by RT (formerly Russia Today) parent ANO TV-Novosti, founded by the Russian state media agency RIA Novosti.",
