  {
   "id": "sec2-2",
   "section": "Reception",
   "text": "In Europe, the media outlet paid London's Daily Telegraph, Le Figaro in France, Süddeutsche Zeitung in Germany, and the Italian daily La Repubblica to be distributed as an insert to those publications, and in the United States it partnered with The Washington Post until 2015; The Wall Street Journal and The New York Times were bundling the insert into their regular editions as of 2018.",
   "words": 66,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 9",
    "Editor 22"
   ],
   "author_words": [
