  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-3",
   "section": "Reception",
   "text": "Beyond the Headlines paid the Daily Telegraph £40,000 per month to be distributed as a supplement to its weekend publication and the Daily Telegraph website also featured content from RBTHs website.",
   "words": 33,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 7"
